506
00:43:49,390 --> 00:43:52,400
Estou familiarizada com
o dilema, senhor.

507
00:43:53,405 --> 00:43:55,780
Mas muito cruel.

508
00:43:55,830 --> 00:43:58,185
Dizem que Lady Montagu
riu

509
00:43:58,190 --> 00:44:01,781
