deste tipo

538
00:46:00,070 --> 00:46:03,620
<i>entre Lady Worsley e
o Capitão Bisset.</i>

539
00:46:03,670 --> 00:46:06,280
E Sir Richard Worsley sabia

540
00:46:06,285 --> 00:46:08,660
