605
00:50:19,990 --> 00:50:21,420
Devo ter tempo
para pensar.

606
00:50:21,470 --> 00:50:23,470
O que mais posso fazer?

607
00:50:26,190 --> 00:50:28,130
Vá até Sir Richard.

608
00:50:29,750 --> 00:50:31,620
<i>Convença-o.</i>

609
00:50:58,750 --> 00:51:01,740
